{{!
    @template block_compass/calendar_skeleton

    The calendar's head before any JavaScript runs (ADR-018 decision 5): it sits above tier 1, so
    without it the mount would push tier 1's skeleton down. Drawn as the strip's first render draws
    it (CalendarStrip.tsx, CalendarLine.tsx), with the same classes and no control: closed, the
    toggle, the line's five waiting cells and the calendar link on one row; open, the toggle, the
    month's bar and the link, then the row's waiting skeleton (its day columns clipped by the row,
    so their number changes no height), the map's line and the waiting note. The view switch is in
    neither, as in React's first render, which knows the views only from the answer.

    What this cannot know is a measurement: on a block under 640 px the strip takes its narrow form
    once the block's width is read, after the first paint, and the closed line moves its cells to a
    row of their own then (CalendarStrip.tsx NARROW_PX). Both this and React's first render draw the
    wide form.

    Context variables required for this template (block_compass\output\block::calendar_head()):
    * style - dots, ring or pulse.
    * open - whether the strip starts open.
    * region - the strip's name, the toggle's text.
    * waiting - the open row's waiting note.
    * icons - expanded, collapsed and collapsedrtl (the toggle's chevrons) and calendar (the link's glyph), core's markup.
    * periods - five items, the closed line's waiting cells.
    * days - the open row's waiting columns.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "style": "dots",
        "open": false,
        "region": "Calendar",
        "waiting": "Loading the calendar",
        "icons": {
            "expanded": "<i class=\"icon fa fa-chevron-down fa-fw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>",
            "collapsed": "<i class=\"icon fa fa-chevron-right fa-fw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>",
            "collapsedrtl": "<i class=\"icon fa fa-chevron-left fa-fw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>",
            "calendar": "<i class=\"icon fa fa-calendar fa-fw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>"
        },
        "periods": [{"cell": true}, {"cell": true}, {"cell": true}, {"cell": true}, {"cell": true}],
        "days": [{"day": true}, {"day": true}, {"day": true}]
    }
}}
<div class="compass-cal compass-cal-style-{{style}} {{#open}}compass-cal-isopen{{/open}}{{^open}}compass-cal-closed{{/open}}" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="compass-cal-head">
        <div class="compass-cal-title h6 mb-0">
            <span class="compass-cal-toggle">
                <span class="compass-cal-togglechev btn btn-icon icons-collapse-expand{{^open}} collapsed{{/open}}">
                    <span class="expanded-icon icon-no-margin">{{{icons.expanded}}}</span>
                    <span class="collapsed-icon icon-no-margin">
                        <span class="dir-rtl-hide">{{{icons.collapsed}}}</span>
                        <span class="dir-ltr-hide">{{{icons.collapsedrtl}}}</span>
                    </span>
                </span>
                {{region}}
            </span>
        </div>
        {{^open}}
        <div class="compass-cal-line">
            <ul class="compass-cal-periods compass-cal-periods-waiting">
                {{#periods}}
                <li class="compass-cal-psk"><span class="compass-cal-sk compass-cal-sk-plabel"></span><span class="compass-cal-sk compass-cal-sk-pchip"></span></li>
                {{/periods}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {{/open}}
        {{#open}}
        <span class="compass-cal-sk compass-cal-sk-month"></span>
        {{/open}}
        <div class="compass-cal-controls">
            <span class="compass-cal-link"><span class="compass-cal-glyph icon-no-margin">{{{icons.calendar}}}</span></span>
        </div>
    </div>
    {{#open}}
    <div class="compass-cal-body">
        <div class="compass-cal-waiting">
            <div class="compass-cal-daysbox">
                <div class="compass-cal-days compass-cal-days-waiting">
                    {{#days}}
                    <div class="compass-cal-col"><span class="compass-cal-sk compass-cal-sk-disc"></span><span class="compass-cal-dots"></span><span class="compass-cal-sk compass-cal-sk-wd"></span></div>
                    {{/days}}
                </div>
                <div class="compass-cal-map"><span class="compass-cal-mapline"></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="compass-cal-foot">
                <p class="compass-cal-note small">{{waiting}}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    {{/open}}
</div>
